/* Two rules for (q0, f): the tree f a b is accepted from q0 through the
   second, which sends the child b to q1; the first sends the child a to q1,
   which has no rule for a.  The rules mean their disjunction. */
%BEGING
S -> f a b.
%ENDG

%BEGINR
f -> 2.
a -> 0.
b -> 0.
%ENDR

%BEGINATA
q0 f -> (1,q1).
q0 f -> (2,q1).
q1 b -> true.
%ENDATA
